{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b44f9a23-2abc-8ddb-891d-4c1d291f26ee",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T14:23:23-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carmela Mancini",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:17:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:17:37-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello? Yes, hello, can you hear me all right? I talk loud, I'm sorry, my ears aren't what they were."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:17:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you fine. Go ahead, what's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:17:52-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. It's about the water in the street. This is Carmela Mancini, I'm at 304 Coggeshall Avenue, up on the Hill. After that nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday, the whole street in front of my house turned into a pond. A pond! And it's still sitting there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:18:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Still there today, Monday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:18:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What? Say that again, honey."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:18:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is the water still there today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:18:24-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, still there. Not as deep as yesterday but the cars come through and throw wakes, like a boat. Right up toward my front steps. I'm standing at the window watching it right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:18:41-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do you know if there's a storm drain right in front of your house, or near it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:18:50-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's one at the corner, I think, by the curb. I can't see it, it's all underwater. Maybe it's clogged up with leaves and whatnot. I'm just worried it's going to come in the house if we get any more rain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:19:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Has water come into the house at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:19:15-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, not yet, thank God. But it's close, the walkway is wet right to the door. And the sidewalk, oh, the sidewalk is a sheet of mud and grit. It's all washed down from up the hill and left there. I'm afraid somebody's going to slip on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:19:39-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense, the runoff carries a lot of sand and silt. I'll put in a work order for the drain and the street flooding at 304 Coggeshall. Let me make sure I have the spelling, that's C-O-G-G-E-S-H-A-L-L?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:19:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What was that last part?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:20:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Coggeshall, with two G's and two L's. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:20:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two G's, two L's, yes, that's right. You got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:20:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And is there a number where the crew can reach you if they need to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:20:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0165. This is my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:20:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-five. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:20:27-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Oh, hold on, my phone is buzzing, hang on. [pause] That's my doorbell. It's one of those smart ones, it sends me a message on the phone whenever somebody walks by. Says there's motion at the front door. Probably the mailman. Sorry, where were we?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:20:50-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. I was just confirming your number. Anything else you can tell me about the water? Is it moving or just sitting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:21:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly sitting. It sort of swirls a little by the corner, where I think the drain is. It's brown, too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:21:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's helpful, I'll note it. Brown standing water near the corner, possible blocked catch basin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:21:20-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can I ask you something? Do the crews work on weekends? Because this happened Saturday and Sunday and I figured nobody was out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:21:32-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They do get called out during a big storm, but the routine work orders, like this one, get sorted on weekdays. Since it's Monday, yours is going in with everything else from the weekend. They're busy right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:21:50-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I figured they would be. It's just that I'm by myself most of the day and I look out and see it and I get nervous, you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:22:04-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. If the water starts coming toward the house or anywhere inside, call us right back, and if it ever feels like an emergency, call 911."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:22:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Call back if it comes in. Do you think they'll come today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:22:24-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be today, could be tomorrow. I'd say within a day or two, depending on what's ahead of yours on the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:22:35-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A day or two. Okay. Can you say that louder, my hearing, I only got the day part."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:22:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A day or two, probably."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:22:47-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, thank you. That's better than nothing. And you'll tell them about the mud on the sidewalk too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:22:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm adding it right now. Mud and grit on the sidewalk in front of 304, slip hazard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:23:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful. You're very kind, dear. I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:23:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Mancini. Hang in there, and call if anything changes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:23:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Bye-bye now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T14:23:21-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now."
    }
  ],
